Subject: [PATCH] compound suite name: narrative suites move into extension
 <Type> named after their test file, nested suites into extension
 <Type>.<Parent> (overnight/compound-suites.py); parse-checked; builds pending
 (coenttb/work#242)

---
 Tests/Random Tests/Random.Generator Tests.swift | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Tests/Random Tests/Random.Generator Tests.swift b/Tests/Random Tests/Random.Generator Tests.swift
index d8333fd..a53f255 100644
--- a/Tests/Random Tests/Random.Generator Tests.swift	
+++ b/Tests/Random Tests/Random.Generator Tests.swift	
@@ -33,9 +33,15 @@ extension FailingGenerator: Random.Generator {
 }
 
 @Suite struct `Random generators fill buffers and propagate typed errors` {
+}
+
+extension `Random generators fill buffers and propagate typed errors` {
     @Suite struct `Random generators preserve filling errors and checked conformances` {}
+
     @Suite struct `Random generators fill large buffers and permit state mutation` {}
+
     @Suite struct `No additional random generator integration cases are defined` {}
+
     @Suite(.serialized) struct `No random generator performance cases are defined` {}
 }
 
